WEBVTT

00:02:01.038 --> 00:02:03.079
Ladies, gentlemen, this is
Captain Pressor speaking.

00:02:03.329 --> 00:02:06.163
I know it's been a little bit turbulent,
especially in the economy,

00:02:06.621 --> 00:02:09.454
but it's going to smooth out. Thanks
for listening with us today.

00:02:12.538 --> 00:02:16.788
I'm Adam Grant and this is work like my
podcast with the TED Radio Collective.

00:02:17.288 --> 00:02:21.496
I'm an organizational psychologist. I
study how to make work, not suck.

00:02:22.079 --> 00:02:23.663
In this show. I take you inside

00:02:23.663 --> 00:02:27.121
the minds of fascinating people to
help us rethink how we work,

00:02:27.121 --> 00:02:32.246
lead and live today, navigating
career turbulence,